---
title: Install pipeline
---
flowchart LR
  install([uze install]) --> manifest[agents.yaml]
  update([uze update]) -->|the declared ref, not the locked revision| resolve
  manifest --> resolve[Resolve marketplaces]
  resolve -->|unreachable by declaration| skip[Skip it, and name it]
  resolve --> mirror[(Marketplace mirror<br/>bare, no blobs, fetched not re-cloned)]
  mirror -->|commit + digest| lock[agents.lock]
  mirror --> acquire[Acquire the plugin's subdirectory]
  linked[/Linked to a checkout<br/>this machine develops/] -->|tracked and new, minus ignored| acquire
  linked -.->|pins nothing| lock
  acquire --> trust{Trusted?}
  trust -- no --> refuse[Refuse]
  trust -- yes --> store[(Store)]
  store --> engine[Engine]
  engine --> router{Router}
  router -->|native| native[Native plugin]
  router -->|generated| generated[Generated package]
  router -->|adapter| adapter[Safe adaptation]
  router -.->|none| unsupported[Unsupported]
  native & generated & adapter --> receipts[(Receipts)]
  receipts ==> context[Reconcile AGENTS.md]
